WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>I cannot reveal its exact location.</i>

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.990
<i>That information is classified at the 
nation's highest level of secrecy.</i>

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.010
<i>Nanba Prison...</i>

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.430
<i>Japan's largest prison, 
with the latest technology</i>

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.500
<i>and top guards, giving it the world's 
highest-level security network.</i>

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.880
<i>No one has ever escaped from this prison.</i>

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.010
Just kidding!

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.690
If you've been watching thus far,

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:38.140
you know there's an inmate who's 
escaped several times, right?

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:39.890
Someone's escaped?!

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.480
But we just increased security!

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.390
Who could it be?

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.770
Do you even have to ask?!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:20.510
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:30.000
<b>Nanbaka Is a Comedy Anime.</b>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:41.640
<b>Throb Throb</b>

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.100
That hurt, Hajime!

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.950
Well, you shouldn't be in here sleeping!

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.320
I ran all over Building 13!

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.870
You'll go bald if you're 
angry like that all the time.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.850
Say that again and I'll tear 
you apart, you little shit!

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.100
Hurry up and give me your hands.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.120
I'm too busy for this.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.350
<b>Whack</b>

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.740
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.360
<b>Yaaank</b>

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:57.740
<b>Yaaank</b>

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.110
You're gonna tear me in two!

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:03.370
<b>Building 13, Cell 13</b>

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.370
Ow... Damn Hajime...

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.740
He's so merciless.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.400
Yet you still never get tired of doing this, huh?

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:12.880
Jyugo really can't do anything 
besides jailbreaking.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.670
Well, you'll just have to learn 
some new things from now on.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.630
Yeah...

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:21.780
It's the same old thing every day.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:24.050
You escape, then come back.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.610
Such a peaceful routine.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.270
Can you really say that in prison?

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.640
<i>It's just like any other day.</i>

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.650
<i>But! Don't forget, people!</i>

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.270
<i>This is the beginning of part two of Nanbaka!</i>

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.650
<i>There's no way these typical days will continue!</i>

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.360
<b>Warden's Office</b>

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:42.960
Hmm...

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:48.740
What should I do about Number 
15's escape the other day?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:54.120
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:54.120
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:54.120
<b>Ba-dump</b>

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:54.120
<b>Warden</b>

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:53.670
Apparently Hajime Sugoroku is on his 
way to see me about Number 15.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.120
<i>What should I say?!</i>

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.000
<i>I guess I should start by 
saying, "Good morning."</i>

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.890
<i>But what if my voice 
cracks from nervousness?</i>

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:06.510
<i>That would be too embarrassing!</i>

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.260
Warden...

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.520
G-G-Good mor—

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.650
I'm so happy to see you, honey.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:19.540
Bastard! Stop messing with me!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:24.280
Hajime Sugoroku would never 
say something like that!

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.780
V-Vertical drop brainbuster...

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.160
Use a better photo, would you?

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.330
Yet you're still keeping it.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.070
Warden, I'm here about Number 15...

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.060
G-Good morning.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.310
Wh-What kind of ritual is this?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.440
I feel like this same thing 
happened four episodes ago...

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.690
<i>It's a typical day in Nanba Prison.</i>

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:08.070
<i>Nothing's going to happen? No, that can't be!</i>

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.530
If I use this...

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.000
Yamato-san... No, even the supervisor will...

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.810
<i>Seitarou, what are you up to?!</i>

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:19.210
<i>Can it be insurgence?! 
Supplanting your superiors?!</i>

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.670
I finally got it!

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:23.210
My NAMBA!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.400
<i>A robot vacuum?! It's not a R(bleep)mba!</i>

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.550
<i>It looks similar, but it's not that!</i>

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.560
<i>Now that I have this,</i>

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:33.560
<i>cleaning the guard room 
should be much easier.</i>

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.350
All right, I'm gonna use it now! Off you go!

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.190
So tired...

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:43.290
Outta my way.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.070
<b>Pssss</b>

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.070
<i>What the heck is this?!</i>

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.890
<i>Some kinda heartwarming comic strip?! 
Jeez, Building 13 is useless!</i>

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.860
<i>Maybe something's happening 
in another building!</i>

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:56.330
<b>Building 5</b>

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:56.330
<i>Let's try Building 5!</i>

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.130
<i>What are they fighting over?! Good, good.</i>

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.220
<i>I've been waiting for a situation like this!</i>

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:10.650
Wh-Wh-Where did you get it?!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.850
My family brought it for me.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.230
Cute li'l cactie...

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.100
<i>A cactus?!</i>

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.670
I'm begging you. Let me 
take care of it for a bit.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:25.230
You really like plants, don't you?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.400
Plants have infinite possibilities.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.740
You can make as many medicines and 
poisons as there are species of plants.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.210
Hmm...

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.890
And it's a pharmaceutical chemist's job 
to research them and make it happen.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:37.760
So...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:38.930
You can't have it!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:39.750
Why not?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.130
If trash touches my cactus, 
it'll catch their trashiness.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.620
Hey! Isn't that kinda cruel?! Please!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.180
Just let me water it, please!

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:54.640
What are you guys doing?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.400
I'm watering it.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:59.140
<b>They've agreed he can't touch it directly, so this happened.</b>

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.960
It's a compromise.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.800
<i>A heartwarming story again?!</i>

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.660
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.900
<i>We're gonna go this route in part two?!</i>

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.280
<i>Forget it! Let's move on!</i>

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.280
<b>Game Room</b>

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.780
I just realized something incredible.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:13.530
<i>What?! An incredible secret 
is about to be revealed?!</i>

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.910
You were in <i>Record of Fuu-un War:
Ninja Kamikaze</i>, weren't you?

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:20.540
Huh?

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:22.040
There's no doubt about it!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.880
You play the main character, Sasuke Kamikaze!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:28.050
<b>Record of Fuu-un War
Ninja
Kamikaze</b>

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.840
<i>The viewers already know that!</i>

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.050
<i>We did it in part one already!</i>

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.620
I'm afraid you're mistaken!

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.180
I'm just a ninja who happened to be passing by.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.080
He probably just looks like him.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.570
What would a celebrity be 
doing in a place like this?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:39.310
Don't say Ninja Kamikaze is just a celebrity!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:44.360
<i>Ninja Kamikaze</i> is considered 
Japan's greatest masterpiece!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.940
Kamikaze does all his own stunts 
and never uses a stuntman.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.320
It's all on the first-press limited edition DVD—

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.490
<i>What's with this guy? He's an expert!</i>

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.500
Anyway, you're the real deal.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:56.700
You can't hide it from me.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.330
No, I'm, uh...

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.270
You in trouble?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.590
They found out?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.700
Yeah...

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.590
So if they find out, it's bad?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:15.750
The actor who plays
Ninja Kamikaze will be a criminal.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:27.610
<b>Mutter...
Mutter...</b>

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.170
Ninja Kamikaze is a legendary ninja.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.240
He's a character who can never be caught,

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:23.980
so if people find out I was actually caught,

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.610
I might disappoint the 
fans who supported me!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.330
<i>He said he was gonna quit,</i>

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.610
<i>but that acting job is important to him.</i>

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:36.560
But the actual me is clumsy 
and nothing like a ninja.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.120
I've spread makibishi around myself, and...

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.500
Then I won't tell anyone.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.580
<b>Whoosh</b>

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:42.370
<b><i>Ba-dump</i></b>

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.870
On one condition.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.620
One condition?

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.820
Kamikaze's autograph! All right!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.760
I don't understand you.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.380
You're the only person I know who'd 
get excited over a fake autograph.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.340
I don't care.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.670
<i>There's no way I'd be disappointed 
by meeting the real Kamikaze.</i>

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.740
<i>What a great story. What a great fan!</i>

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.890
<i>Wait, that's not what I wanted! Forget it!</i>

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.020
<i>Inmates are useless! Idiots!</i>

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.020
<b>Guard Room</b>

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.520
<i>I'm counting on you, guards!</i>

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:12.530
Th-This is...

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.780
<b>Petite</b>

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.280
S-So cute.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.140
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.760
<i>Skin white as snow!</i>

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.440
<i>Cheeks the color of cherry blossoms!</i>

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.910
<i>Eyes as beautiful as rubies!</i>

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.670
<i>Such a delicate design! Just like the warden!</i>

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.920
Ten thousand yen for one.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.430
Wanna buy it?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:41.430
Hey, Hajime! How many times do I have 
to tell you this is a no-smoking area?!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.680
Is it?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.050
Go outside if you want to smoke!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:51.940
<b>Nag Nag</b>

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:49.450
What if my beautiful hair
ends up smelling like smoke?!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.940
Who gives a damn about your hair?

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.860
Jeez, Hajime is such an idiot.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.070
Hey, Monkey!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.560
Don't eat while doing your paperwork!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.610
And throw away your trash!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.910
You're not a child anymore!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.080
You, either.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:04.450
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:04.830
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:08.540
Sheesh! The men around here have no manners.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.200
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:05.700
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:06.200
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:06.620
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:06.960
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:07.460
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:07.830
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:08.210
<b>Huff</b>

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.290
Where do they think this is?

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.250
That tickles!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.200
You! No animals are allowed in here!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:30.230
<b>Break
Room</b>

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.600
No pets allowed!

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:22.580
Don't worry. Yamatomaru is
not a pet. He's family.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.870
What's his job title, anyway? "Mom"?

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.640
That's not the point!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.120
More like "annoying old hag."

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:28.050
<i>It's a typical day for the guards, too.</i>

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.230
<i>Well, I guess I'm one of them.</i>

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:34.190
<b>Building 13, Cell 13</b>

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:34.190
Nothing ever happens around here.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:36.260
Isn't that a good thing?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:41.110
<b>Delicious</b>

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.510
This looks good!

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.110
I'll ask Shiro to make it sometime.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.830
Yeah! Hooray for the hero!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.440
It's boring,

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:46.410
but that's not bad.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.410
You're right. A typical day is the best.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.510
<i>Yeah, I agree.</i>

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.330
<i>But it can't go on like this!</i>

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.630
<i>Part A is about to end!</i>

00:10:55.980 --> 00:11:00.090
<i>Give me some kind of incident,
please! An incident!</i>

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:02.620
Where are you?

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.110
There!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.420
<i>A new development at last!</i>

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.060
<i>Maybe?</i>

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:17.070
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:22.070
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:25.620
There!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.750
<b>Guard Cat Kuu</b>

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.750
<i>All that for a cat?!</i>

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:35.960
Don't climb up to high places. 
You won't be able to get back down.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.080
G-Good morning, sir!

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:44.090
I will be working hard today as well, sir.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.060
<b>Supervising
Officer</b>

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.300
Um... I've been meaning to ask, but...

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.860
Why is there a cat in the guard room?

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:53.720
I greet him out of habit, but...

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:56.340
Who are you calling a cat?! Watch your mouth!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.600
Kuu-dono is your superior!

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.610
I'm outranked by a cat?!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.040
Well, he is my cat,

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.240
and he's been working here 
longer than you have.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.620
You're kidding me!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.000
I found him,

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.750
<b>Trot Trot</b>

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.750
<b>Floof</b>

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:14.380
but I can't have a pet at home.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.510
You're like a dog.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.890
A cat...

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.780
Ta-da!

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:34.140
It's Kuu. You brought him here again?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.490
I couldn't help myself.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.730
That's gonna get you in trouble one day...

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.360
But, but, he's too cute!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.050
Rock can't stand it, meow!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.340
Here.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:48.740
<b>Flinch</b>

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.070
No, no! If I touch a cat,

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.770
something awful will happen.

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:54.250
Something awful?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.500
Okay! Jyugo, you go! Walk closer to Nico!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.020
Why?!

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:04.130
I wanna see what happens!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.950
Then you go!

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.560
Just go already!

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:08.640
One, two!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.070
Happy now?

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.650
I'm sorry! Don't look at me!

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.380
Just the face turning into 
a cat is kinda gross.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:25.640
Rock, your ears!

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:26.660
Meow?

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.910
<b>Warden's Office</b>

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.680
Warden, here is this week's report.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.410
<b>Report
Visit to Building 13</b>

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:31.410
Yes.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.290
I'm relieved to know there 
have been no incidents.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.790
Thank you, ma'am.

